        "sid": "ECC 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo kumkumbuke Muumbi wako ngelo kuko mdawana; imbiri matuku na miaka ya wasi isechee; ingelo kuchaaghora “Siwueboilwa ni irangi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo iyo, iji mwengere ghwa iruwa na mori na nyerinyeri ghuchawuya kira kwako, na mawingu gha vua kuwuya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo ichacha mikonu yako ikulindiagha ichaasughusika, na maghu ghako ghiwadie ndighi idana ghichasilwa ni ndighi. Maghegho ghako ghichasighwa matini ghedafuna vindo, na meso ghako ghichasera kira kusedimagha kuwona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Madu ghako ghichafwa kusedimagha kusikira chwaka ra chienyi, na lwaka lwa mtambo ghushagha angu chumbo riborwagha. Ela sena lumbo luborwagha ni nyonyi luchakuwusira dilonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchaobua andu kwa ighu, na kughenda kuchakaia ndengwa, Kuchabukwa ni imbu kusedimagha kughenda, na bea rose richasia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wichaghenda andu kwawo kohoresha kwa kutua, na wandu wichakaia wikilila chienyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiwina ya feza ichadumbuka, na taa ya dhahabu ichapotoka na kubarika, na mtungi ghwa machi kubarika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wichawuya ndoenyi, na roho iwuye kwa Mlungu uo oreifunyireghe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni maza ra duu, waghamba Mchili; maza rose ni duu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kutua kwa malagho",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kukaia Mchili orekoghe na hikima, ukachuria kuwifundisha wandu agho oreghimanyireghe. Orekufundishireghe mifwano na kuzighana wuloli ghwaro nicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mchili ukalola malagho ghiboie na gha loli, ukaghiandika nicha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Madedo gha mundu wa hikima gheeka sa mzata ghusongokie gholisha mfugho, na mifwano itumbanyiro sa misumari ikomerelo ikamanga. Eenekwa ni Mlungu, uo Mlisha odu isi diwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanwapo, kukulindie na ilagho jingi jichurilwagha aighu ya agho. Kudunga vuo vingi ndekuwadie kutua, na kushoma kungi kwadasirisha mumbi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutua kwa malagho ni uku: Maza rose ramerie kusikirwa. Muobuo Mlungu na kuiwadia memu yake, angu ihi niyo kazi ya mdamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu Mlungu uchatanya kula ilagho dibonyagha jikaiagha jiboie angu jizamie; hata agho ghibonyero kivisonyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
